From: Astro SSR Fix <fix@dmitrybond.tech>
Date: Mon, 21 Oct 2025 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(security): Add Content-Security-Policy to middleware

Add CSP headers to HTML responses for enhanced security.

FEATURES:
- CSP для всех HTML страниц
- Разрешены inline scripts/styles (нужно для Astro SSR)
- Разрешены внешние источники: Iconify CDN, jsDelivr

TESTED:
- ✅ CSP не блокирует критические ресурсы
- ✅ Iconify icons загружаются
- ✅ Inline styles для theme-toggle работают

SECURITY:
- Защита от XSS атак
- Ограничение источников загрузки ресурсов
- Соответствие OWASP best practices

---
 apps/website/src/middleware.ts | 14 ++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/apps/website/src/middleware.ts b/apps/website/src/middleware.ts
index 1234567..abcdefg 100644
--- a/apps/website/src/middleware.ts
+++ b/apps/website/src/middleware.ts
@@ -68,6 +68,20 @@ export const onRequest: MiddlewareHandler = (context, next) => {
   
   // Process all other requests (HTML, API, etc.)
   return next().then(response => {
     const contentType = response.headers.get('content-type') || '';
     
+    // Content Security Policy for HTML
+    if (contentType.includes('text/html')) {
+      response.headers.set('Content-Security-Policy', [
+        "default-src 'self'",
+        "script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://api.iconify.design",
+        "style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'",
+        "font-src 'self' data:",
+        "img-src 'self' data: https:",
+        "connect-src 'self' https://api.iconify.design",
+        "frame-ancestors 'none'",
+        "base-uri 'self'",
+        "form-action 'self'"
+      ].join('; '));
+    }
+    
     // Admin pages: strict security + no-cache
     if (pathname.startsWith('/website-admin/')) {
       response.headers.set('X-Frame-Options', 'DENY');
-- 
